%N A398241 Number of simple graphs on n unlabeled vertices with feedback vertex set number 1.
%H A398241 Eric Weisstein's World of Mathematics, <a href="https://mathworld.wolfram.com/FeedbackVertexSetNumber.html">Feedback Vertex Set Number</a>.
%F A398241 a(n) = Sum_{m=1..n} A398243(m) * A005195(n-m). - _Martin Fuller_, Aug 08 2026
%e A398241 a(1) = a(2) = 0 since graphs with 1 or 2 vertices are already acyclic.
%e A398241 a(3) = 1 corresponds to the cycle graph C_3.
%e A398241         o
%e A398241        / \
%e A398241       o---o
%e A398241 a(4) = 4:
%e A398241      o---o   o   o   o   o   o---o
%e A398241      |   |   | \     | \ |   | \ |
%e A398241      o---o   o---o   o---o   o---o
%e A398241 The last of these is the first that is not unicyclic.
